{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_04",
  "title": "无人的小巷",
  "storyCode": "DV-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f8d95ad9115077a26c6286fd844d55a937af5f8315cef5c88fd15c6360081efe",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "第六具动力甲，确认瘫痪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些就是全部？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看起来是这样。他们成功拖住了我们十三分钟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "扫描结果显示，还有第七具！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的动力甲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_526_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士小心！它往你的方向去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的动力甲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_526_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "让我来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你看不清塞雷娅是怎么移动的，在你的双腿反应过来之前，她已经站在了你的面前。\n你知道，在哥伦比亚的街道上，她从来不会带上那面莱茵制造的盾牌。\n她会把自己变成盾。\n从她交叠的小臂上，珐琅质迅速生长开，替你挡下了动力甲的一击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "害虫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你听到塞雷娅低声说。\n她一直这么看待这些失控的哥伦比亚技术。\n从她的表情与姿态中，你读出了她下一步的动作。\n在准备消灭害虫的时候，塞雷娅从来不会浪费时间。\n她的手即将触到动力甲的前胸，那里很快就会出现一个黑黢黢的空洞——\n面前这具动力甲会被摧毁，或者说，“死去”。\n一个念头在你的脑子里蹿了上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "停下，塞雷娅！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "塞雷娅也许只听到了你喊出来的第一个音节，但她的确收了手。\n这是你们长期并肩作战累积下来的信任。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她的拳头错开了核心，可攻击的余波依旧震碎了动力甲的上半截外壳。\n从无数飞溅的金属碎片中，你看到了一抹亮色。\n就像......发丝。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，危险！别靠近——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "动力甲正在倒下。\n更多碎片飞了出来，很快，你看到了更多发丝，一点皮肤，然后是一只眼睛。\n那只眼睛看向了你。\n愤怒，惊恐，迷茫......你在一瞬间读出了很多情绪。\n而在所有情绪随着伪装的外壳一起剥落之后，你发现它在向你求救。\n于是，你伸出了一只手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你好，缪尔赛思。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "迈尔，这是怎么回事？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不知道......我不知道，领队......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你先放开摩尔医生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "医生......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
          "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不能放开她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你不听我的命令？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "领队，你为什么还跟她们站在一起？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你不是说，我们必须狠下心来对她们下手吗？你不是说......我们只是她们豢养的实验动物吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是你劝我跟你一块干的。我本来......我很喜欢摩尔医生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......没想到，最先站出来反对我的人会是你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我甚至想过会是萨姆，或者其他人......迈尔，你从来都最听我的话。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你也说过，我太听话了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "以前我听老板的，在工厂里得了矿石病......来了这里，我就听你的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你们都是有本事的人，聪明，读书多。我觉得听你们的不会错。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但现在......我们都要死了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "桑尼，我们都快被这几个做研究的人害死了！她们还觉得自己能控制一切！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不信的话，你搜一下她，她身上一定有录音用的机器，她这一路上跟着我们就是为了观察我们，也观察那些银色的怪物！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......乌比卡博士，要是有脱困的方法，你该开口了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "埃琳娜......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "奥利维亚，我的确没有把实验信息告诉你......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但我绝对不会骗你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "桑尼，迈尔，我也没有骗过你们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我......真的不知道对付它们的方法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我记录它们的数据，研究它们，都是因为我也想解决眼前的问题......我说过了，这是我工作的一部分。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "迈尔先生，我想埃琳娜没有撒谎。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你能把乔伊丝还给我们了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哈......哈哈哈......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "拓荒者盯着白面鸮，突然抬手。\n一声叫喊凝在了赫默嗓子眼，无人机接收到了主人的意志，狠狠撞向拓荒者的身体。\n可他只是从白面鸮手上取下了一样东西。\n那是他在几个小时前亲手给她戴上的紧急医疗环。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
          "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我......我都干了些什么啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "摩尔医生......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你会怪我吗？你会不会后悔曾经对我那么好？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我这样的人......根本不配被你拯救。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "医生回到了她的朋友们身边。她依然安静，美丽，无瑕。\n可是所有人都无处可逃了。这座实验室就是一个为他们提前准备好的墓穴。\n没有人能得救，这该死的环只是那该死的公司给他们套上的镣铐。\n他们都得不到自由，除非......\n拓荒者突然把紧急医疗环整个塞进了嘴里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "迈尔！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "领、领队......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你在干什么？快吐出来！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这医疗环......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "里面还剩大量止痛剂。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一口气吞掉这么多，心脏根本受不了，他会休克的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我见过......有人偷偷地把这个吞下去......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他们都死了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那他们很......幸运。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "该死，你给我吐出来！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我按住他的嘴，萨姆，你给我揍他肚子！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "咳咳......咳咳咳！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "再加把劲，我看到医疗环的形状了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "奥利维亚，我们一起帮他——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......奥利维亚？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......乔伊丝。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
